Villagers who gathered on Sunday, November 14, 2021, could not stand the irresponsible act, told Fresh News that they had contacted the local administration several times to help resolve the issue. People who lose their jobs cannot go to work on time or lose money every day to repair vehicles due to the company's lack of responsibility.
