Meanwhile, Mr. Meung Youleng, Director of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Kandal Province, told Fresh News Agency in the province that he would look into the case and ask people to submit a letter of intervention to the department so that he could be summoned. The car team and stakeholders came to ask questions and to order the road to be rebuilt for the people.
However, as of November 16, 2021, the sand company has not been able to contact yet.
