(Phnom Penh): At least 38 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on November 15, 2021 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News on November 16.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 38 suspects, 12 were arrested in nine criminal cases and 26 were arrested in nine drug cases.
