Please note that the Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology has issued a notification on the weather in Cambodia from 11 to 16 November 2021. The ministry confirmed that Cambodia would be affected by the foot of the high-pressure wing at the junction of the low-pressure Pacific Valley from the bottom up. This will cause light to heavy rainfall in some areas, which may cause flash floods.
