Ms. Chhay Kim Sotheavy also said that this painting competition aims to raise awareness about the effects of alcohol use on students and young people, especially to support effective measures to reduce accidents caused by Alcohol consumption among students and youth as well.
Kampong Cham Provincial Authority Prepares to Build Standard Public Toilets for Residents
(Kampong Cham): The Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Un Chanda, assigned the relevant officials and authorities in Kampong Cham City to find suitable public places to build standard public toilets for the people to use in order to avoid defecation to improve the well-being of the people. Improve the aesthetics in Kampong Cham.
The provincial governor mentioned this plan on the morning of November 15, 2021 at the 30th Ordinary Meeting of the third mandate of Kampong Cham Provincial Council.
