HE Nguon Socheat and his family send a letter of thanks to Her Majesty Queen Norodom Monineath Sihanouk for the message of condolence on the death of His Excellency Dr. Nguon Nhel
Once again, all of us and our families, His Majesty the King, bow down and give our best wishes to His Majesty the Queen Mother of the Khmer Nation. May you be blessed with four blessings: Age, class, happiness, and strength, do not waste your time to live in the cool shade of peace and prosperity for all Cambodians for a long time to come.
