But even though the road has been reopened, people are still unable to travel because a large number of the old road is covered with forests and bamboo forests and deep canyons due to being abandoned for many years. As for the new road built by Mr. Khov Keat, it was not allowed to be used by the people and it was closed only after the people's representative submitted a request to the provincial governor of Kampong Chhnang again to repair this old road to serve the public interest.
People's representatives said that if the provincial authorities reopened this road, people who want to travel from Kbal Teuk commune, Teuk Phos district to the waterfall tourist area in Omlaing commune can travel on this open road. It is only 6 kilometers to the waterfall.
