Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration recommends 7 points for factories, enterprises, companies, hotels, casinos and businesses when the province is open to vaccination tourism
(Preah Sihanouk): Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration on November 12, 2021 recommended to implement 7 points for factories, enterprises, companies, hotels, casinos and business establishments when the province is open to vaccination tourism.
1: End the censorship and continue to work, as well as stop the censorship for employees, workers in factories, enterprises, companies, hotels, casinos and all business establishments.
2. Owners or managers of factories, enterprises, companies, hotels, casinos and all business establishments must allow their employees to enter and leave the business location as agreed or can go out to rest at their home or residence later. At the end of working hours.
3: Owners or managers of factories, enterprises, companies, hotels, casinos and all business establishments must strengthen the implementation of health rules and measures "3 protection and 3 do not" of the Prime Minister with his staff, workers, employees as well as visitors. Services.
6. In the event that a case of Kovid-19 infection is found to its staff, the site owner must report it to the local authority and the nearest health officer to refer the patient to Kovid-19 Hospital or allow He goes home for treatment (after a medical evaluation of the patient).
7. After the employee has recovered from Kovid-19 disease, with the confirmation from the provincial health department, he must be allowed to return to work at the place without discrimination.
