Ministry of Industry Celebrates and Congratulates Dr. Cham Prasidh on Receiving an Honorary Doctorate Degree from Kirirom Institute of Technology
Dr. Leng Phirum, Director of the Institute, Represented by Mr. Takeshi Izokak, Founder of ETHO Town Cambodia and Chairman of the Board of Directors of the Institute, conferred the first honorary doctorate degree since the establishment of the Kirirom Institute of Technology in 2014. Senior Minister, Minister of Industry, Science, Technology and Innovation based on three main factors:
* Factor 1: He is a mature dignitary with full experience in leading relevant national institutions in the fields of trade, industry, science, technology and innovation in Cambodia, which is an essential mechanism for the executive branch in the development of the country and National honor on the international stage.
* Factor 2: He led national dignitaries to attend key events to defend Cambodia's position on the international stage and seek experience related to trade, industry, energy, science, technology and innovation with many developed countries in the world. Inputs for national policy preparation to promote and facilitate relevant sectors, especially small and medium enterprises in Cambodia.
