As of November 12, 2021, Cambodia has identified 19 cases of Kovid 19: a total of 119,421, a total of 115,797 have been cured, a total of 2,856 have died. The Cambodia-China Stung Trang-Kroch Chhmar Friendship Bridge will be officially inaugurated on November 23 under the presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen
(Kampong Cham): After being temporarily in operation for nearly eight months, the Cambodia-China Stung Trang-Krouch Chhmar Friendship Bridge, a new bridge across the Mekong River connecting the territory of Kampong Cham to the territory of Tbong Khmum, has decided to open. The official inauguration will take place on November 23, 2021 under the presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
This was confirmed by Mr. Lim Sidenin, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, this morning, November 12, 2021, on the occasion of the representative of Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, leading the working group with the participation of Mr. Un. Chanda, Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Cheam Chansophoan, Governor of Tbong Khmum Province, including the participation of construction companies and other relevant officials.
The purpose of this inspection was to check the progress of the preparatory work of each committee and sub-committee, to check the location to find a solution to the request, as well as some issues that each committee and sub-committee encountered. Experienced during the performance of its work.
Please note that this bridge is an important strategic bridge to connect the transportation and travel of people in Kampong Cham and Tbong Khmum easily and quickly, people have traveled through this area through. The bridge ferry is also a place with high potential to serve the national economy, improve living standards through the growth of development, investment and tourism.
The Cambodia-China Stung Trang-Kroch Chhmar Friendship Bridge is located at Boeng Deng village, Prek Kak commune, Stung Trang district, Kampong Cham province, across the Mekong River to the east bank in Kdol Leu village, Trea commune, Krouch Chhmar district, Tbong Khmum province. The construction site of Kampong Cham province to the territory of Tbong Khmum province was opened on February 08, 2018 under the high presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
