(Pailin): General Y Chhean, Secretary of State of the Ministry of National Defense and Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group, on the afternoon of November 11, 2021, lit a candle to commemorate the 68th Anniversary of National Independence Day, November 9 and the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces Birthday. (November 9, 1953-November 9, 2020) Held at the Independence Monument, Pailin City, Pailin Province.
The event was attended by deputies, presidents of provincial councils, provincial leaders, government officials around the province, the three armed forces, the people, the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, the Provincial Youth, the Cambodian Red Cross, the youth scouts and teachers, students. That, too.
