The Cambodian Foreign Minister made the remarks at the launch of a research paper in support of the 13th Asia-Europe Meeting, entitled "The 13th Asia-Europe Meeting: Multilateral Cooperation for A Sustainable, Sustainable and Legal Future for ASEM ”on November 11, 2021.
