This operation took place on November 10, 2021, led by Brigadier General Keut Khmer: Commander of Trapeang Prasat District Gendarmerie and in collaboration with 3 Provincial Gendarmerie, led by Colonel Ly Darith, Commander. Sub-province cracked down on a drug trafficking case in Popel village, Phav commune, Trapeang Prasat district, Oddar Meanchey province.
As a result of this operation, the military police arrested one suspect, Hong Thida, female, 28 years old, false occupation, living in Ou Svay village, Ou Svay commune, Trapeang Prasat district, Oddar Meanchey province.
Currently, the suspects and exhibits are being processed by the district military base and sent to the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Gendarmerie Command for legal action.
