Veal Veng District Forestry Administration Officer Killed at Forestry Administration Office
(Pursat): A forestry administration official in Veal Veng district, Pursat province, was robbed and killed with seven knives, causing him to die in a pool of blood, and then escaped with a large number of materials, which is suspected to be a case of resentment.
This incident caused a surprise at 8:31 pm on November 10, 2021 at the Forestry Administration Office in Veal Veng District at Tuol Krous point in Stung Thmey village, Bramoy commune, Veal Veng district, Pursat province.
Sources from the competent authorities told Fresh News Agency that the victim was named Seng Visal, 52 years old, occupation: Forestry Administration Officer, Veal Veng District, residence: Peal Nhek 1 Village, Sangkat Phteah Prey, Pursat City, Pursat Province.
Police confirmed that an unidentified suspect used a machete on the victim on November 9, 2021, seven knives, causing death at the scene (in the room on the bed). After the action, the suspect fled into the shadows.
Currently, the authorities and a team of doctors have been conducting an autopsy on the body to find the suspect, causing a case to be processed. The bodies were handed over to the victims' families for traditional rites.
