The Royal Ballet: The Phnom Penh Capital Administration has temporarily opened a new subway from Veng Sreng Road to National Road 4 to avoid traffic jams.
(Phnom Penh): At the construction site of the Choam Chao flyover and subway, the Phnom Penh Municipal Administration has decided to temporarily open a new subway from Choam Chao Boulevard (Veng Sreng Road) to National Road 4 while the team is paving the road. Connects from Russian Boulevard to National Road 4 and the road from Choam Chao Boulevard to Russian Boulevard within 14 days.
According to the Phnom Penh Capital Administration, in order to ease traffic congestion during the paving process, the road connecting Russian Federation Boulevard to National Road 4 and the road connecting Chom Chao Boulevard to Russian Federation Boulevard will be used for the construction of flyovers and roads. The Chom Chao Underground diverted traffic for 14 days, temporarily opening a new subway from Chom Chao Boulevard to National Road 4.
Please be informed that Chom Chao flyover and subway is a project of the Royal Government of Cambodia through the Phnom Penh Capital Administration, under construction contract by the Cambodian Overseas Investment Company (OCIC), with a construction period of 30 months and a construction budget of approximately $ 22 million. America.
Based on the technical specifications of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Phnom Penh, this construction site is divided into 3 parts: the first bridge is the main flyover connecting traffic from Russian Boulevard to National Road 3, with a total length of 408 meters and a width of 15.8 meters With two lanes to two lanes, the bridge slope is 4.5 meters and the maximum height under traffic is 5.5 meters.
The second bridge separates from the main flyover, turns left, connects traffic from Russian Boulevard to Veng Sreng for one-way traffic, with one lane for cars and one lane for motorcycles, with a total length of 202 meters (40 meters of flyover, subway length) 118 meters and the road is 44 meters long and 5.25 meters wide.
The third bridge is a left-turn bridge connecting traffic from Veng Sreng Road to National Road 3 with a total length of 206 meters (60 meters long flyover, 118 meters underground road and 28 meters long overhead road), 5.25 meters wide for traffic. One direction with one lane for cars and one lane for motorcycles.
It should be noted that the flyover and subway at the Chaom Chao roundabout officially opened the construction site on June 29, 2018 under the high presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun. Rany Hun Sen.
