The Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction held a groundbreaking ceremony on January 28, 2020. The building has a distinctive architectural style, designed in the style of contemporary architecture, with ancient Khmer and modern architecture, decorated with traditional Khmer architectural ornaments. This is according to the description of the Deputy Prime Minister.
