(Phnom Penh): Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, on Monday, November 8, 2021, decided to provide food aid to 2 flood victims and the most vulnerable. 786 families (including Ratanakkiri province 1,367 families, Kampong Thom province 777 families, Battambang province 642 families), each family received 25 kg of rice, 1 box of noodles and 10 cans of fish.
