Iran demands US sanctions lifted as talks to resume nuclear deal resume soon
Tehran: The government of Tehran has demanded that the United States lift all its sanctions through a verifiable procedure as talks aimed at salvaging the Iran nuclear deal resume in a few weeks. More. This was released by Reuters on Monday, November 8, 2021.
