A girl was raped and killed by an unknown person in Preah Sdach district, Prey Veng province, the assailant escaped
(Prey Veng): A girl was raped and beaten to death by a stranger at 15:30 on November 7, 2021 in a field in Tuol Chey village, Preah Sdach commune, Prey Veng province. Prey Veng.
Preah Sdach district authorities said that after receiving a complaint from Suon Mai, a 36-year-old female in Tuol Chey village, Preah Sdach commune, she found the body of her 12-year-old son, Phal Phanit, in deep water. 7 meters east, 300 meters from Kadong checkpoint in Tuol Chey village, Preah Sdach commune, who disappeared at 22:30 on November 6, 2021.
Police said that after receiving the complaint, police and doctors arrived at the scene to examine the body, broke the neck, a cut on the right forearm, a cut on the left knee and a scar. Genital warts.
The police further confirmed that according to the conclusion of the police, the girl died due to rape and murder.
Please note that the body is now handed over to the family for a traditional ceremony. As for the suspects in the rape and murder, the authorities are burning their hands and feet to search for the perpetrators and punish them according to the law.
