(Ratanakkiri): Banlung Municipality, Ratanakkiri Province, received some Kovid-19 anti-virus equipment, such as a Kovid spray machine, 30 liters of Kovid antiseptic and 10,000 tablets from the Cambodian-Chinese Buddhist Association and The Cambodian-Chinese Progressive Researchers Association for use in preventing the spread of Kovid-19 within its jurisdiction.
These donations were handed over to the Banlung Municipality on the morning of November 7, 2021 through the National Working Group to Assist Banlung.
