On behalf of the donors and on behalf of Venerable Zhao Xin, Vice President of the Cambodia-China Buddhist Association, and Chea Monirith, President of the Cambodia-China Progress Researchers Association, encouraged Cambodian civil society to continue cooperating with the administration. Sub-national level and with the health sector to contribute to the prevention of Kovid-19 to participate in cutting Kovid transmission.
