The Ministry of Foreign Affairs has confirmed that on November 12, 2021, in the presence of the Heads of State and Government, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni will address the opening ceremony of the General Assembly. This focuses on the key achievements of UNESCO in Cambodia.
