Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of the inauguration of the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction
(Phnom Penh): The office building of the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction, a sacred new achievement of the architecture of the Cambodian nation worth more than 28 million US dollars, was officially inaugurated on November 08, 2021. The ceremony will be presided over by the Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
The building of the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction is an achievement that demonstrates the values of the leadership of the Royal Government of Cambodia in promoting the architecture that is the work of the Khmer children and also shows the ability of the Royal Government to manage and use the budget. Nation to create achievements is a source of pride for the nation as well.
The following are the main remarks made by Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the inauguration ceremony:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was very happy to inaugurate the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the Ministry building was scheduled to be inaugurated in April, but due to Kovid 19 disease, it was postponed until now.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that the new way of life in the 19th Kovid era has made the meeting hall of the Ministry that can accommodate up to more than 2,000 people, but only to about 500 people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recalled the relocation of some ministries after the Ministry of Public Works was built at a new location. These include the Ministry of Mines and Energy, the Ministry of Rural Development, and the location of the National Committee for Disaster Management.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that on December 29, the 23rd anniversary of the end of the war, the Ministry of National Defense will be inaugurated.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also confirmed that the Ministry of Interior is also building and can be put into use in the future with a value of 60 million dollars.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that now is the stage to build the workplace of civil servants. This achievement also shows the evolution of Cambodian society, which in the past did not have a place for officials to work.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara for leading the construction of this ministry building.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that in a meeting with the Australian Foreign Minister, Mariss Plan will discuss many issues, both bilateral and regional, especially those related to the countries that produce paramano.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also confirmed that he did not receive the British Foreign Secretary who visited Cambodia in June. Samdech Techo stated that not meeting at that time was not because of fear.
* Samdech Techo says the Australian Foreign Minister's visit may explain the US-British-Australian Trilateral Alliance (AUKUS).
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia and Australia have good trade relations and trade relations will be better.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech will write three sentences with the inauguration of the office building of the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction. The three notes include: 1. The building is already difficult, but maintaining the building for long-term use is also difficult. Save electricity and water.
* Samdech Techo said that if there is a good workplace but the work is not effective, the bad work is zero.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded about the rescue operation in the building collapse in 2019. Samdech Techo stated that he was shocked by the event when there was no national intervention.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that the value of the savior is on the rescue, regardless of their own lives.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that after becoming the Chairman of the State Council in 1985, Samdech proposed to establish the General Department of Construction. But the General Department only thinks about the construction, not the land. Until after the 1993 election, the construction sector was incorporated under the Ministry of Public Works.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen outraged some analysts want to take the Paris Agreement to solve the problem of Myanmar.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that those who want to recall the Paris Agreement are those who want to call foreigners to rule Cambodia. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that UNTAC has finished its duties and the Khmer Constitution is now the greatest King, why do you want to call foreigners to rule Cambodia?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that Samdech dared to handcuff politicians at 12 o'clock at night, why did he not dare to handcuff those who accused the National Assembly of being illegal.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the incident of attacking Samdech in Siem Reap on September 24, 1998 was to instruct Samdech not to go because he had anticipated a plan to attack Samdech. In the end, there was a real attack, but the prince could not be killed.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is a matter of pride for the Royal Government that the pond has become a construction site for other buildings.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reacts to criticism of the floods in Phnom Penh. Samdech Techo confirmed that the flood due to heavy rain. Samdech Techo confirmed that Samdech used to live in the Sangkum Reastr Niyum era, flooding all over Phnom Penh.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that critics of the floods in Phnom Penh were jealous of development achievements.
