* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the people's need to use wood as a part leads to the loss of forests in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen tells analysts on October 23 not to misinterpret national institutions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has its independence and countries must respect Cambodia's independence and sovereignty.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asks to consider people who say that the amendment of 2/3 to 50 plus 1 is a violation of the Constitution.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the accused Samdech has two nationalities as an opportunity for Samdech to initiate the creation of a law to define a single Khmer nationality for the leaders of the nation's top institutions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech had the same Khmer nationality from birth and never dreamed of this or that nationality.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has assigned three tasks to the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction to complete. The three tasks are: to continue to work to resolve the issuance of land titles to the people, to try to resolve the remaining or new land disputes using out-of-court mediation mechanisms and to be honest, to work to resolve social land issues. Samdech Techo considers social land concessions as a priority work of the Royal Government.
