10 people are lucky among the 10 million people of the 19 Kovid vaccination plan received by Samdech Techo Hun Sen
(Phnom Penh): The gift of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, has been handed over to the people of 10 million people in each of the 10 million lucky people in the Kovid vaccination plan. 19.
The 19 million Kovid vaccination campaign for the 10 million population aged 18 and over by the Royal Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen has been successful ahead of schedule after about nine months. Starting from February 10 to October 31, 2021.
In that, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also announced the awarding of incentives to those who vaccinated in each millionth digit number. In total, at the end of the campaign, 10 people were found to receive this humanitarian gift. Samdech Techo assigned Ms. O Vandin as a staff member to deliver this gift to their backyard.
The 10 people who received gifts from Samdech Techo Hun Sen include:
* 1 million vaccinators: It was Mr. Panh Sovannrith, male, 36 years old, residing at Apartment 2, Prek Pring 2, Sangkat Choam Chao, Khan Por Sen Chey. Mr. Panh Sovannrith vaccinated the first million on April 11, 2021.
* 2 million vaccinated people: 23-year-old Tith Chenda, a factory worker living in Sangkat Choam Chao, Khan Por Sen Chey, who was vaccinated on May 14, 2021.
The third millionth vaccinator was 48-year-old Su Sam Oeun, a widow living in Victory Hospital, Kandal Province, who was vaccinated on June 14, 2021.
7 million vaccinated people: It was on the grandmother named Chan Khim, 67 years old, living in Kantrak village, Sangkat Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap city, Siem Reap province, who was vaccinated on July 28, 2021.
10 millionth vaccinator: It was 89-year-old Sok Phat, a resident of Treang village, Slor Kram commune, Siem Reap city, Siem Reap province, who was vaccinated on October 31, 2021.
It is noteworthy that upon receiving the donation from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, all 10 of them expressed their perception of the benefits and values of vaccination against Kovid 19. They claim that because of fear of a global pandemic and confidence in the Royal Government of Cambodia, they volunteered to be vaccinated against Kovid.
They also sent a message of deep gratitude to Samdech Techo Hun Sen through Ms. O Vandin in the effort to find a vaccine to give to the people because there is no clear consideration from the head of the Royal Government. He does not yet have a vaccine to protect him.
In addition, they also thanked the prince, in addition to finding the vaccine, and also provided humanitarian donations for them when each millionth injection.
At the same time, Mrs. O Vandin, the leader of the team to take the humanitarian donations of Samdech Techo Hun Sen to the above 10 people, always sent many messages related to the efforts of the Royal Government of Cambodia and reminders. About the health measures, especially the 3 preventive measures and 3 measures of the Prime Minister to prevent Kovid 19.
