King Kong Sam Ol pays tribute to the late Dr. Nguon Nhel
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Chao Feang Kong Sam Ol, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of the Royal Palace, this morning, Saturday, November 6, 2021, paid tribute to the late Dr. Nguon Nhel, First Vice President of the National Assembly, who passed away yesterday.
On the occasion of paying his last respects, Samdech Kong Sam Ol expressed his heartfelt condolences and deep sorrow over the death of Dr. Nguon Nhel with his family.
Samdech Kong Sam Ol emphasized that the death of Dr. Nguon Nhel was the loss of an exemplary human resource, an outstanding figure who sacrificed his physical and mental resources and mentality to serve the country.
Samdech Kong Sam Ol also highly appreciated the heroism and great merit of Dr. Nguon Nhel who contributed to the struggle for national liberation and national development in all circumstances, especially actively contributed to the legislature and the Royal Government of Cambodia. Serve the best interests of the motherland in the past.
