Preah Vihear Provincial Administration Celebrates the 68th Anniversary of National Independence Day and the 17th Anniversary of the Reign of His Majesty the King
(Preah Vihear): This morning, November 6, 2021, the Preah Vihear Provincial Administration held a celebration to celebrate the 68th anniversary of the 9th Independence Day (9 November 1953-9 November 2021) and the 17th anniversary. The year of the reign of His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of Cambodia.
The ceremony was held in the presence of Mr. Long Sovann, Chairman of Preah Vihear Provincial Council, Mr. Prak Sovann, Governor of Preah Vihear Province, with the participation of Provincial Councilors, Deputy Governors, Armed Forces, Government Officials, Citizens, Teachers, Students, Youth, Cross. Red, Youth Scouts and many more from the Union of Cambodia.
On behalf of the Provincial Council, Mr. Prak Sovann expressed his appreciation for the hard work of the leaders and civil servants of the Armed Forces who have participated in maintaining peace, defending the territorial integrity with the most courageous and strong, especially in the direction of the Temple of Preah Vihear. .
In celebration of the 68th Anniversary of National Independence Day and the celebration of the enthronement of His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia, on behalf of the provincial leadership, organized a family of heroes. There is a lack of family merit to receive humanitarian gifts as encouragement.
