Tour operators are busy attracting tourists to Cambodia after the Royal Government announced the opening of safe tourism at the end of this month (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): While the Royal Government of Cambodia has set a specific time to reopen international tourists operators Domestic tourism has been promoting the country as a destination to attract tourists in Asia and Europe so that they can visit Cambodia in the future.
Cambodia has decided to open safe or vaccinated tourism from November 30, with the first phase starting in Sihanoukville and Koh Kong, the target provinces of the pilot process.
Ho Vandy, an adviser to the Cambodian Tourism Association, told Fresh News that members of the Cambodian Tourism Association have different markets and advertising destinations, some of which are focused on attracting tourists from Asia, the European Union, the United States and Australia. . In this promotion, the association has organized 5 to 7 tour packages to provide more options for tourists.
"Right now we see that in the case of the reopening, European visitors have high hopes, but now the pilot project, as well as the project that was created, is new, so we look forward to seeing that," he said. "The beginning of the execution, the beginning of the attraction, because it depends on the direct action can be judged."
Mr. Thuon Sinan, President of the Asia-Pacific Tourism Association of Cambodia, said that both the association and his company have been widely promoting to target countries and all partners in the world, however, the reception is only in Sihanoukville. And Koh Kong in the early stages did not seem to be able to attract a large number of guests, with most types of services or food focused on the Chinese, which made it difficult for one of the association's promotions to other countries.
Ms. Khay Chenda, Vice President of the Cambodian Hotel Association, said that she has not yet advertised to find a tourist market because she does not have enough funds to advertise as her market focuses on European guests.
"To be honest, in the last two years, our hotel has lost money, there is no income, only expenses, no budget to advertise, because advertising to the international market requires a lot of money, not less, so it is difficult until the time of lack of funds. Do you know what kind of media we have? ” Ms. Khay Chenda further confirmed.
