Pursuant to the Law on the Administration of Medicines and the Law on the Amendment of the Law on the Administration of Medicines, all circulation of all kinds of cosmetic products in the Kingdom of Cambodia must be recognized by the Ministry of Health.
The Ministry states that people before buying all kinds of cosmetic products, please check the ID card that is affixed on the packaging and the correct ID card is 2 parts 1- The upper part is named Import Export, 2- The bottom Contains identification numbers as attached.
