Chea Sim Kamchay Mear University completely denies posting on social media untrue about the university's land clearing
(Prey Veng): Chea Sim Kamchay Mear University on November 4, 2021 completely denied the posting on social media which is not true about the university's land clearing.
Regarding the above information, Chea Sim Kamchay Mear University would like to inform the public at all levels as well as the media:
* First, the land being cleared is owned by Chea Sim Kamchay Mear University, which is registered as an inventory of state property and has a legal title to the right to occupy immovable property, No. PW 003516, dated January 21, 2011. Department of Land Management, Urban Planning, Construction and Cadastral Affairs of Prey Veng Province.
* Second: In the past, Prey Veng Provincial Administration, Kamchay Mear District Administration and Chea Sim Kamchay Mear University have cooperated and facilitated the invitation of the people who illegally occupied this land to cooperate and facilitate the invitation of the people to occupy the land. This land is illegally recognized and contracted to stop the encroachment, occupation and cultivation of illegal crops on this land for the university to develop and serve the education sector.
* Third: Currently, Chea Sim Kamchay Mear University is developing this land to become a model farm for research and development in the field of agriculture, including animal husbandry and crop cultivation, to give university students the opportunity to research, intern and Disseminate new agricultural knowledge to local communities.
* Fourth, the University would like to confirm that SB Farm has cooperated to provide seeds for the cultivation and purchase of products from students as well as communities that produce agricultural products to find markets and improve the living standards of students. As well as the community, not involved in the clearing occupied by Tycoon Ny Sambath, as mentioned in a media outlet.
Chea Sim Kamchay Mear University "I am very sorry for the new Earth website that was published without understanding the facts, as well as a complete denial of the false information that was published and requested the Earth website "Correct your articles as much as possible to avoid confusing readers of the New Earth website as well as the public."
