Mr. Say Kim Lam brought greetings from the Heads of Government, including Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen and Mr. Nguon Rattanak, Governor of Kampong Thom Province, who always take care of the well-being of the people in Locals, especially Samdech Techo Hun Sen, worked hard to protect the fight against Kovid 19, in which Samdech also shared his sadness with the family of the deceased.
Mr. Say Kimlam stated that currently the rate of infection and death due to Kovid 19 has decreased significantly and the number of government officials, the Armed Forces and people across Cambodia have been vaccinated against Kovid-19. More than 13 million already. Most of the recent deaths are those who have not been vaccinated and those who have been vaccinated and are able to recover quickly.
