(Prey Veng): Mr. Chea Somethy, Governor of Prey Veng Province, on the morning of November 4, 2021, paid a courtesy call on members of the Khmer Agricultural Farmers Community and inspected the vegetable production situation in Khpob Village, Prek Sambour Commune, Peam Chor District, Prey Veng Province.
