(Svay Rieng): The Svay Rieng Provincial Administration has issued instructions on the issuance of the 19 Kovid vaccination card or the 19 Kovid vaccination certificate every time you access the service at tourism service businesses and tourist resorts in the province. Prevent the spread of Kovid 19. According to the instructions received by Fresh News on November 4.
The provincial administration has stated that the measure is aimed at improving the control of the Kovid 19 epidemic, aiming to strengthen community resilience to counteract the spread of Kovid 19, especially the new strain of the virus. ) As well as to prepare for living with Kovid 19 in the new normal trajectory leading to the reopening of all sectors in the near future.
In addition, the provincial administration has instructed the municipal / district administration, departments and units around the province, the management of educational institutions, the management of the market, the tour operators, the business owners, the tourism services, the private sector, the people and the public to follow the following principles:
* First, all persons who enter and exit the provincial halls, departments, units around the provinces, municipalities and districts are obliged to show the Kovid 19 vaccination card or the Kovid 19 vaccination certificate issued by Ministry of Health or issued by the Ministry of National Defense.
* Third: All educational institutions, the school management must be obliged to set up a mechanism to check the immunization cards of teachers, educators, students properly before being allowed to enter their institutions.
* Fourth, all educational institutions, management, business owners have an obligation to monitor all officers, staff and service workers working in their business locations to ensure that they have been vaccinated. .
* And 5: In the case of educational institutions, the management of any business owner who is allowed to operate but does not follow the above guidelines will face the revocation of the license or business license and may lead to the closure of the location and take action. Legal (in accordance with the Law on Measures to Prevent the Outbreak of Kovid 19 and Other Deadly and Dangerous Diseases) and the relevant legal documents in force.
