Mr. Ith Sam Heng volunteered for cremation, Mr. Oum Mean showed great honor
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Ith Sam Heng, Minister of Labor and Vocational Training, in the morning of November 3, 2021, offered the cremation of Mr. Oum Mean, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training, who passed away on October 30, 2021. 2021 at 3:16 AM at the age of 76 due to illness.
The death of Mr. Oum Mean is the loss of her husband, father-in-law, great-grandfather, great-grandfather, great-grandfather, great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-great-grandfather. Every man and granddaughter.
The loss of Mr. Oum Mean is the great loss of a model Cambodian who, in his lifetime, has built countless merits for our country and our motherland.
Please be informed about Mr. Oum's life and brief biography as follows:
As a child, Oum lived under the care of his parents and was a virtuous son with a proud demeanor, gentle demeanor, and a high level of diligence in learning and helping others. Dear all of you in the community.
Oum Mean married Miss Chai Kim Yuk on November 10, 1967. As a result of their married life, they had five sons and one daughter, one of whom died.
As for Mr. Oum Mean's work history, during 1965 after graduation, he worked as a teacher at Krakor Secondary School in Pursat Province and from 1970 to 1975 as a secondary school teacher at Prek Leap Secondary School.
During 1979, when the country had just recovered from the devastation and destruction of the Pol Pot regime, the country needed human resources to participate in the rehabilitation and development of the country. Worked as the Head of the Department of the Federation of Trade Unions of Cambodia.
From 1998 to 2003, Mr. Oum Mean worked as the Director General of the General Department of Labor at the Ministry of Social Affairs, Labor, Vocational Training and Youth Fitness.
From 2008 to the present, he was Secretary of State at the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training.
In 2018, Mr. Oum Mean was elected a member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party in the Extraordinary General Assembly of the Cambodian People's Party. Within the framework of the party leadership of the Ministry, he is a member of the Standing Committee of the Ministry Party Committee and Chairman of the Education Propaganda Committee of the Party Committee of the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training.
In the working life of Mr. Oum Mean, he is a leader with a good example for subordinates, he has good morals, high tolerance, he is an official loyal to the leadership and also a model officer who is clean, dignified, honest and professional. Have a high will and patriotic conscience unwavering.
Mr. Oum Mean is also a Buddhist who always obeys the advice of our Samma Samput, our teacher Preah Chinsrey. Apparently, in the past, he always spent his personal wealth together with his family, sons, daughters, relatives, close friends and relatives to perform the merit-saving ceremony and keep it as a field in both the field of Buddhism and countless empires.
