(Phnom Penh): Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate, on November 2, 2021, sent a message of condolences on the death of Mr. He Kan, the husband of Ms. Sun Maly, Advisor to the Royal Government and former Deputy Governor. Phnom Penh.
