Getting vaccinated quickly is an important part of leading to the success of this vaccine. Samdech Techo Hun Sen also carefully analyzed the decision to find a country to supply the vaccine, and finally decided to use China as a strategic reference on the supply of the vaccine.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stressed that whatever matters, starting from the assessment of the situation must lead to the correct measures, and this is something to remember.
Not only the vaccination, Samdech Techo Hun Sen is the head of the Royal Government, who is known to have decided on many things related to the fate of the nation, and the decision always brings success for the leadership of Samdech as well. Success for the nation and the people of Cambodia as a whole.
Samdech Techo's historic decisions include the decision to seek Vietnamese intervention to liberate the nation on June 20, 1977, and the establishment of a negotiated policy with His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk to reach an agreement to end the conflict. On October 23, 1991, and the launch of a win-win policy ended the presence of the Khmer Rouge guerrillas on December 29, 1998.
These successes cannot happen if Samdech Techo Hun Sen's decision is incorrect or unrealistic.
