The site of the Islamic Center in Phnom Penh, which already has the Al-Sar Mosque at Boeung Kak Lake in Phnom Penh, will be developed to regain economic resources to support and develop the Cambodian Muslim community in a number of areas, especially the provision of scholarships to students, orphans, the elderly and the poor. Etc.
