BEIJING, Oct. 26 (Xinhua) - A video expert meeting of the 2021 Beijing Xiangshan Forum concluded in Beijing on Tuesday night. More than 50 intellectuals from more than 20 countries have noted that they should adhere to multilateralism, cooperation and win-win to jointly safeguard world peace and stability.
The US-UK, Australia-Australia trilateral security partnership (AUKUS) and nuclear submarine cooperation have led to arms competition and nuclear proliferation risks. After the rapid withdrawal of US and NATO troops from Afghanistan, Afghanistan faces challenges such as the humanitarian crisis, the rise of terrorism and the spread of Kovid 19, which poses a new threat to regional security.
Remarkably, as experts from around the world were finding ways to address security challenges at the Xiangshan Forum on October 25, the US aircraft carrier convoy conducted exercises with self-propelled grenades. Defend the Sea of Japan. Humanity has the same destiny. Such an American act will only aggravate the situation in the region. It is clear that such an act is contrary to the general trend.
