The city of Jiamusi has not yet reported any community-related cases in the latest outbreak, but said the city will issue a one-week alert until March 3. This coming November. City authorities have demanded a reduction in gatherings and a ban on visiting nursing homes and mental health centers, and have barred tourists from entering the city.
