* Workers are advised to clean their hands regularly at work.
Increase attention to disinfection in the workplace, production buildings and shared use areas.
* Instruct workers to wear masks regularly and adhere to the recommendations of Samdech Techo Hun Sen "3 do not 3 protect".
* Establish a system to monitor and monitor the health of workers in factories.
