The press release quoted Samdech Techo as saying, "From January 1, 2022 onwards, tax-free vehicles will not be able to travel on the road, it is an illegal vehicle that will be subject to the strictest and strictest measures. "
Samdech Techo emphasized that if necessary, if it is necessary to crack down on tax-free luxury cars owned by army chiefs, police chiefs or senior members of the Royal Government, deputies and senators who do not respect the law and continue to use the car, Report the identity of the car owner to Samdech so that Samdech can take measures to remove him from office and expel him from the party.
