On the other hand, Ms. Srey Sotheavy, Director of ACT, also said that on behalf of (ACT), she was very grateful to the journalists in Kampong Chhnang for their professional coverage in the past to reflect the general situation in the society. To inform the masses and for the relevant institutions to help solve all the challenges in the society to achieve peace.
The Director (ACT) also stated that in the future direction (ACT) will increase more training courses to help strengthen the capacity of other journalists to have the right professional ethics to write news together to help resolve conflicts. And end disputes outside the judiciary and disseminate information to the public.
