The Senate Expert Committee has begun reviewing and studying the draft amendments to the Constitution regarding the determination of a single Khmer nationality for the heads of the four top institutions.
(Phnom Penh): The draft law on the amendment of the Constitution and additional constitutions related to the determination of a single Khmer nationality for the position of President of the Senate, President of the National Assembly, Prime Minister and the Constitutional Council has entered the Senate. On the morning of October 26, 2021, the Senate Expert Committee began reviewing and studying the draft law.
Meeting to review and study the draft Constitution on the amendment of Article 19 (new), Article 42 (new), Article 106 (new), Article 119 (new) and Article 137 (new) of the Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia and Article 3 and Article 4 of the Constitution to supplement The normal functioning of the national institution was chaired by Mr. Icon, Acting Chairman of the Sixth Committee of the Senate.
