The Draft Law on the Amendment of the Constitution and the Additional Constitution concerning the determination of a single Khmer nationality for the leaders of the highest institutions, including the President of the National Assembly, the President of the Senate, the Prime Minister and the President of the Constitutional Council, was fully approved by the National Assembly by 111 votes to 111 votes. In the plenary meeting on the morning of October 25, 2021 by a vote of 111/111.
In this amendment, the supreme law of the nation is prepared to be amended in 19 new articles, 42 new articles, 106 new articles (a), 119 new articles and 13 new articles of the Cambodian Constitution and 3 additional articles of the Constitution.
