International Analysis: How Can the US Defend Taiwan?
(Washington): If the United States really wants world peace, why continue to modernize the military? One obvious answer to this question is to defend oneself, the interests of the United States and its allies in response to any threat or attack from the enemy. But there is another reason why the United States must maintain its best military capabilities and capabilities to prevent war from erupting.
