Woman jailed for business partner fraud
(Phnom Penh): A Phnom Penh Municipal Court judge has decided to detain a woman named Sok Vanthy after she was sued by her business partner for not being responsible for the joint venture.
According to the information, the woman named Sok Vanthy lost the joint investment money from the joint venture partner and was sued by the partner to get the investment money back, but Sok Vanthy tried to evade without paying the investment money back to her partner.
After encountering this problem, the investment partner filed a complaint to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court. The Phnom Penh Municipal Court summoned the woman several times to address this issue. However, the woman refused to come to court and issued an arrest warrant for the authorities.
The woman was arrested by the police of the Ministry of Interior on October 24 and was remanded in custody on October 25, 2021.
