According to the report of the General Department of Technology of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, the progress of the construction of 38 roads in Siem Reap as of October 15, 2021 in more than 11 months reached 83.87 % Of total work volume (2% faster than planned). The project is scheduled to be completed by the end of December 2021.
