He noted that fertilizer prices had risen steadily since March, and by June-July, fertilizer prices had soared.
He urged the relevant parties to intervene to bring down the price of fertilizer to a reasonable price, but if the price of fertilizer can not come down, please help the intervention to increase the price of agricultural products in proportion.
