(Phnom Penh): In order to share knowledge to the public, the Public Administration Regulator has prepared an article explaining what is the end of Public Administration? .
The administration is terminated in some cases, such as:
1: Arrival of the deadline specified in the letter of administration, 2: Achieving the objectives of the administration, 3: Decision made by the discretion or unanimous opinion of the governor - 4, according to the decision of the competent court Or 5: In other cases as stated in the administrative letter.
Upon completion of the Board of Governors, the Board of Governors shall submit the report of the Board of Governors to the Regulatory Administration (DRC) or relevant regulatory authorities, with details of the remaining capital, income, expenses and other necessary information in accordance with the relevant regulations. In force.
The Board of Governors shall continue to exercise its power until the completion of the clearing, and the clearing officer shall be selected by the person responsible for overseeing the administration.
The remaining title after clearing must be divided or given to the Governor or other persons as stated in the letter of administration or as state property (Law on Public Administration 2019). Mr. Mar Yarith: Journalists must know how to write, do not write!
