Some bars in Takhmao City secretly open karaoke in violation of the ban of the provincial administration, people waiting to see the authorities
(Kandal): A credible report revealed to Fresh News Agency in Kandal province that in many bars in Takhmao City, they secretly opened karaoke rooms with Srey Nhy Oun Bong close to violating the ban of the provincial governor. Kandal, while the provincial administration allows the reopening of the shop, but must comply with the principles of health, especially the karaoke singing room is not yet allowed.
But in recent days, it has been observed that people are crowded in almost every restaurant in Takhmao City and other districts in Kandal Province, mixing karaoke singing, which is a risk increase for the transmission of the Kovid 19 virus against government measures. .
The report whispers that since the Kandal provincial authorities allowed the opening of the bars, the bars and massage parlors have been operating normally under the guise of pretending to sell only plain rice and scratching but secretly embedding alcohol. And sexual massage contrary to the ban of the Royal Government.
This has led to criticism from citizens of all walks of life who fear the transmission of the Kovid 19 virus, saying it violates the Kandal provincial governor's ban while awaiting action by the Kandal provincial governor. How well managed.
