The production of products made from the work of Khmer children is to make these products into products that have a taste of Khmer and high quality with hygiene standards, officially recognized by various institutions and receive Also certified to standard Cambodian halal products.
Senior Minister Osman Hassan praised the efforts of Rari Handicraft with high success and encouraged to continue to produce other consumer products by obtaining halal certification to compete in the local market and reach distribution. Into the world market because the handicrafts meet the standards of modern production chains, comply with high hygiene standards, and also receive certification of Cambodian halal products.
He mentioned another factory he visited earlier this month, the company acknowledging the volume of sales of its products between before and after the certification of halal products, the company achieved a sales increase of about 30%, which is an important message for handicrafts, factories, enterprises, food products and services to turn to the technical certification of halal products to increase sales to boost the Cambodian economy.
