(Preah Sihanouk): The Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration on October 22, 2021 issued a decision on the termination of the Challisak Center and the Kovid-19 Clinic at The Century Casino and the suspension of the casino business.
The above Century Casino is located at Street 823, Village 5, Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville.
