(Phnom Penh): The Telecommunications Regulator of Cambodia on October 21, 2021, cooperated with the Inspectorate of the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications to crack down on the theft of the 16-kilometer-long fiber-optic cable network of Smart Asiata Co., Ltd. Three different locations in Takeo and Kampong Speu.
A statement from the Telecommunications Regulator of Cambodia, obtained by Fresh News on October 21, stated that as a result of the crackdown, all exhibits were confiscated and stored for further legal action and arrest. Some related individuals and lawsuits against Smart Asiata Co., Ltd.
Along with this crackdown, the Telecommunications Regulator of Cambodia will continue to inspect the construction of all fiber optic networks throughout the country to ensure that the construction is carried out in accordance with the legal and technical.
The Telecommunications Regulator of Cambodia, Sangkat Thorn, said, "Telecom regulators of Cambodia always inform and advise all telecom operators to pay attention to the implementation of the law consistently." However, some telecom operators continue to violate the law, in the case of Smart Asiata Co., Ltd., which was cracked down on today.
Mr. Ly Chantola told the Bar Council of the new mandate Internal Solidarity to consider and uphold the interests of the Bar Association.
(Phnom Penh): "Let all the members of the 10th Mandate Bar Association join me for the excellence and prestige of the legal profession." This is the request of Mr. Ly Chantola, President of the Bar Association of Cambodia on October 21, 2021 in the transfer and inauguration of the 33 newly elected members of the Bar Council of the 10th mandate.
Mr. Ly Chantola provided some recommendations and suggestions to the members of the Bar Council of the 10th mandate to ensure the effectiveness of the work to achieve excellence and prestige of the legal profession, including:
1: Please strictly abide by the internal rules of the Bar Council.
2. There must be good internal unity, consider and uphold the interests of the Bar Association as a whole.
3. All meetings and discussions of the Bar Council are confidential. There are many reasons why the rules of procedure of the Bar Council clearly state this secret. Some discussions and decisions are related to the honor or reputation of the lawyer, the names of supporters or non-supporters, as well as the strategy of the Bar Association. Any disclosure of information to third parties shall be made through the dissemination mechanism of the Bar Association.
4: Must attend meetings regularly and on time.
5. To study, research and be active in debating how to ensure that each decision of the council is reasonable and comprehensive.
Mr. Ly Chantola also added three more suggestions:
1. Take care of the well-being of the Bar Association and the difficulties or problems that the Bar Association helps in the profession and take immediate and effective intervention measures.
2: Please share knowledge and experience to colleagues and promote the legal profession as much as possible to the public.
3: Must also pay attention to their behavior, both in the profession and in society.
The election process for the 110-member 10th Bar Council went smoothly and fairly earlier this week. The President of the Bar Association of Cambodia commended all the candidates who complied with the laws and regulations on campaigning for support within the 30-day deadline.
