(Phnom Penh): Mrs. Pum Chantyny, Secretary General of the Cambodian Red Cross, received a donation of US $ 3,500 from Bhikkhu Chirpanho Kou Sopheap, a professor at Pannasastra University at Wat Koul Toteung, to help build a house for Cambodian veterans.
