Prior to the announcement of the reopening of higher education, the Royal Government of Cambodia recently decided to reopen schools from secondary school onwards. The Rector of the National University of Management thanked the Prime Minister for allowing the reopening of higher education, which they considered to be the right consideration as the steering wheel of the Royal Government, as well as to raise the standard. More education.
