What does the symbol of the torch relay, the torchbearer, and the torchbearers' clothing of the Beijing Winter Olympics look like?
(Beijing): The torch relay is the main theme and symbol of the Olympic Games and the cultural vision of the Olympic Games, and also an important way to express the values and concepts of the Olympic Games and create The atmosphere for the Olympics as well.
On October 20, the torch relay of the Beijing Winter Olympics torch relay and costumes were unveiled to the public for the first time. The Olympic spirit, with its fireworks display and full expression of the rich cultural meaning and cultural beliefs of the host country and host city.
The torch is designed in accordance with the laws of nature and incorporates everything. The creative idea comes from Zun, a traditional Chinese shrine.
The design of the darts runners includes five Olympic rings and the darts sign. A uniform includes a suit, hat, gloves and athletic shoes. After 10 months of innovation and production, the symbol of the Beijing Winter Olympics torch relay has been made public.
