Takhmao City Authorities Continue to Detain 9 Night Sand Trucks in Violation of Officials and Authorities
(Kandal): Authorities in Takhmao Municipality, Kandal Province, seized 9 trucks transporting sand at night and kept them waiting to be weighed. If they are overweight, the authorities will punish them according to the law.
The operation took place on the night of October 19, 2021, led by Mr. Nou Sovannara, Governor of Tat Khmao, Mr. Moeung Youleng, Director of Public Works and Transport of Kandal Province, Mr. Phim Madonna, Deputy Governor of Takhmao City and many other relevant officials. More.
Mr. Nou Sovannara said that the seizure of sand trucks over the deadline was to tighten compliance with traffic rules and circulars of the municipal administration to control the violation of the law by sand trucks.
According to Circular No. 006 of the Ministry of Mines and Energy, it is strictly forbidden to transport substances beyond 6 pm, ie can travel from 6 am to 6 pm. If any car commits a crime, the relevant authorities, especially the traffic police, have a great obligation to enforce the law.
