(Stung Treng): On Sunday morning, October 17, 2021, Mr. Svay Sam Eang, Governor of Stung Treng Province, led the relevant departments and units to inspect the progress of the construction of a concrete bridge in Ba Deum village, Sam Khuy commune, Sesan district. Of the Royal Government through the Provincial Department of Public Works and Transport, 60 meters long and 8 meters wide, is scheduled to be completed at the end of December 2021.
